msgctxt "136"
msgid "...How was I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"You were brilliant, Kiryu-chan! Especially the ad-lib.\r\n"
"I loved the ad-lib! And the impact... It was like I was\r\n"
"watching the real thing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Really? I didn't think my delivery was convincing enough for\r\n"
"a samurai film. Maybe I put a little too much \"me\" in there..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Samurai film...? Well, whatever. Anyway, I've got your\r\n"
"payment waiting. Go get changed first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"Nice work, Kiryu-chan. You stuck to the script just as\r\n"
"written."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "It was almost perfect, but needed a little something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Acting's not my thing, I guess. And I haven't watched many samurai films."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Samurai films...? Well, whatever. Anyway, I've got your\r\n"
"payment waiting."
